WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
Pause in a safe position.

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:10.480
Whatever has already happened today does not need to be denied or repaired in these three minutes.

3
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.065
Feel one place where the body is supported.

4
00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:25.812
Notice one breath entering and one breath leaving.

5
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:31.807
It can be short, uneven, or quiet.

6
00:00:33.507 --> 00:00:37.952
This breath does not have to prove that you are calm.

7
00:00:44.535 --> 00:00:47.295
Perhaps the morning went differently than planned.

8
00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:56.185
Perhaps attention wandered, patience ran out, or something remains unfinished.

9
00:00:57.885 --> 00:01:02.860
Name only this: that was the earlier part of the day.

10
00:01:09.443 --> 00:01:13.923
Feel the next exhale reach its own end.

11
00:01:15.623 --> 00:01:20.058
There is a small space before the next inhale.

12
00:01:21.758 --> 00:01:30.328
A new beginning can be this ordinary: not a clean slate, simply another available moment.

13
00:01:39.105 --> 00:01:50.640
Look around and notice three stable things: a color, an edge, a sound, a surface, or the light.

14
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.380
Let the present become specific.

15
00:02:00.964 --> 00:02:07.744
Ask what one kind and workable action belongs to the next few minutes.

16
00:02:09.444 --> 00:02:19.739
It might be returning, apologizing, resting, asking, drinking water, or beginning one small piece.

17
00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:23.079
Choose only one.

18
00:02:30.978 --> 00:02:34.018
Take a natural breath with that choice.

19
00:02:35.718 --> 00:02:38.998
You do not need confidence before starting.

20
00:02:40.698 --> 00:02:44.773
Feel the body prepare for the first movement.

21
00:02:50.040 --> 00:03:00.000
Begin again from here, bringing the past with honesty and carrying only what the next step needs.
